<title>UK: Credit Local sets 3.0 bln Lux franc bond. [CORRECTED 10:26 GMT]</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 3.0 bln Lux franc bond. [CORRECTED 10:26 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Internationale a Luxembourg and Credit Communal/Gemeentekredit.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    10.JUN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.65    PAY DATE  L-10.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    YIELD	 4.50</p>
<p> (Lead manager corrects yield from 5.50 to 4.50)</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  FRANCE    PRAECIPIUM  0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
